            "description": "# JsToPy\r\nA library that add to python some js functions.\r\n\r\n## Installation\r\n`pip3 install JsToPy` or `pip3 install --user JsToPy`\r\n\r\n## Why JsToPy?\r\nJsToPy makes JavaScript code using in Python.\r\n\r\nJS code:\r\n```js\r\nvar this = require(\"a-lib\");\r\n\r\nvar nums = [];\r\nnums.length = 10;\r\nnums.fill(\"Foobar\");\r\nconsole.log(nums);\r\n```\r\n\r\nUsing JsToPy:\r\n```py\r\nimport JsToPy\r\n\r\nthis = require(\"a-lib\");\r\n\r\nnums = [];\r\nnums.number = 10;\r\nnums.fill(\"js in python\");\r\nconsole.log(nums);\r\n```\r\n",
